WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:35.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:39.200
The camera's on, the smile is bright

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:44.000
Another take in the fluorescent light

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.800
They painted the ceiling a counterfeit blue

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:52.200
It never felt real, it never felt true

00:00:52.300 --> 00:00:56.800
I'm looking past the studio glass

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:00.200
Watching the constellations pass

00:01:00.500 --> 00:01:05.000
We were living under a plastic sky

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:09.000
They told us to jump, we asked how high

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:13.000
Just a painted stage, just a paper lie

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:21.500
Now we're breaking through the plastic sky!

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:25.800
Drifting out where the real stars shine

00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:36.000
Leaving their artificial world behind!

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:52.000
[Instrumental Break]

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:56.500
They wanted it safe, they wanted it thin

00:01:57.000 --> 00:02:02.000
Polished away every spark within

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:09.800
We wanted to soar through the endless night

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:14.000
So we tore down the roof and we took to flight

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:18.500
I'm looking past the studio glass

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:22.200
Watching the constellations pass

00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:26.800
We were living under a plastic sky

00:02:27.000 --> 00:02:30.800
They told us to jump, we asked how high

00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:34.800
Just a painted stage, just a paper lie

00:02:35.000 --> 00:02:43.200
Now we're breaking through the plastic sky!

00:02:43.400 --> 00:02:47.500
Drifting out where the real stars shine

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:58.500
Leaving their artificial world behind!

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:06.500
Was that the dream we were chasing down?

00:03:06.600 --> 00:03:11.000
A borrowed mask in a hollow town?

00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:18.000
No more ceilings, no more chains

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:27.000
Only the infinite sky remains!

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:54.500
[Synthesizer Solo]

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:59.500
We were living under a plastic sky

00:03:59.600 --> 00:04:03.500
They told us to jump, we asked how high

00:04:03.600 --> 00:04:07.800
Just a painted stage, just a paper lie

00:04:08.000 --> 00:04:16.000
Now we're breaking through the plastic sky!

00:04:16.200 --> 00:04:20.200
Drifting out where the real stars shine

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:32.000
Leaving their artificial world behind!

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:37.500
Beyond the plastic sky...

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:43.000
Into the velvet blue...

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:47.500
[Outro]
